WEBVTT

00:00:56.667 --> 00:01:00.559
This lingo came into play
when the Bronx was burning,

00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:04.018
and movies like "The Warriors"
and "Fort Apache"

00:01:04.042 --> 00:01:05.583
still make an impression.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.351
Some may disagree,

00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:10.583
but I believe the Bronx
was designed to fail.

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:15.167
The power broker was a joker.

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:19.893
Robert Moses, instead of
parting the Red Sea,

00:01:19.917 --> 00:01:22.518
he parted the Bronx
with a six-lane highway

00:01:22.542 --> 00:01:24.083
and redlined my community.

00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:27.958
My great-grandparents
had a home on Featherbed Lane,

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.893
and contrary to the name,